Package: BioDataLedger
Title: Inspectable Scientific Project Records
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("Nizar", "Batada", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "nizar@example.org")
Description: Records exact data, analysis and figure references, and exchanges
    reviewed local project bundles. It does not execute scientific analyses.
